editor_description = "Coastal palm crown (PRP-COAST-006). Shape the fronds in assets/source/props/palm_crown.blend. Here, the seed picks which mature and old fronds, stubs and dead fronds this tree shows, spread evenly round the trunk, and turns each frond a few degrees, so no two palms carry the same crown."
